silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ColimitAboveGraniteYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'ColimitAboveGraniteYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, if the apex were a storage node, the universal-mediator arrow u: VetCarePlan_77 -> apex would be a storage arrow, but VetCarePlan_77 is a clinical summary node, not a storage node. The universal property fails if the apex is forced into the storage layer. (04_colimit_above_granite.tex, Theorem 1.3 proof)" .
